.
.  Generate sample output for Cauchy Survival plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
set ipl1na causur.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Cauchy Survival
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Survival
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT 1-CAUCDF(X) FOR X = -10 0.01 10
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv CAUSUR.PS causur.ps
.
quit
